�Dodeka allokota diegemata, dodeka paraxenes istories...
1. "To tromaktiko mustiko tou Ainstain"
Oi skismenes selides enos paliou emerologiou pou epesan tukhaia sta kheria mou, apokaluptoun stoikheia gia ena tromaktiko mustiko sto opoio emplekontai o Almpert Ainstain kai to Amerikaniko Polemiko Nautiko!
2."Amar"
Enas adistaktos Marokinos gkagkster einai etoimos gia ola, okhi omos gia ten pragmatikoteta pou antikruzei xaphnika mprosta tou...
3. "To domatio me tous kathrephtes"
Uparkhei arage pepromeno; Ginontai ta oneira pragmatikoteta; Ti einai arage pio odunero; O thanatos e e zoe; Oi apanteseis dinontai sto domatio me tous kathrephtes...
4. "Ena mpouketo orkhidees apo to pouthena"
Otan ena mpouketo orkhidees apostelletai ston paralepte tou apo ton allo kosmo...
5. "Thanasimo oneiro"
To oneiro mpleketai me ten pragmatikoteta kai to uposuneideto... E mepos telika ola einai paikhnidia tou mualou;
6. "O Dias sto Facebook"
E paraxene istoria mias photographias sto Facebook kai e skhese tou Dia me ena Germano rok star kai ena pentakhrono agori.
7. "E Alike to ethele polu"
Merikes phores den einai kalo na epithumoume kati para polu, epeide mporei telika e epithumia mas na pragmatopoiethei...
8. "Skholike ekdrome"
Kapoio phobero atukhema se skholike ekdrome odegei ena koritsaki se metathanatia empeiria.
9. "O katadioktes tou Tzak"
E tukhaia sullepse tou adistakhtou egklematia Tzak apokaluptei ena metaphusiko dromeno.
10. "E gunaika pou epese apo psela"
Poia istoria mporei na krubetai piso apo ten ptose mias gunaikas apo to parathuro;
11. "Mekhri pou tha paei aute e balitsa;"
Oi komikotragikes peripeteies mias balitsas kai tou idioktete tes, pou katelexan na ginoun brabeumeno muthistorema.
12. "E peripeteia enos onomatos e Giati Andreas Kapandreou"
E peripeteia kai e exelixe enos onomateponumou."�
�<>.
Abraam Kaoua, suggrapheas
Agapete anagnoste,
men apheseis ton titlo na se paraplanesei. Osoi phobountai to skotadi, den ekhoun dei poso epikinduno mporei na ginei to phos.
E kolase mporei na einai mia diastase pou gennaei skotadi. E enas topos olo phos. Phos aneleeto. Mporeis na peis me bebaioteta pou katoikoun oi puknoteres skies;
Oi dekatreis skoteines istories sten prote sulloge diegematon tou Kostantinou Kelle tha se odegesoun se mere gnorima, opos enas xekhasmenos pharos e ena spiti gemato koukles, ena grapheio psukhologou e mia paralia ste mese tou kalokairiou... Tha se taxidepsoun omos, kai sto parelthon e se topous pou den ekhoun these stous anthropinous khartes. Apo ena aneliago dasos gemato khamena paidia eos mia pole pou moiazei na xepedaei apo ta kharaktika tou Eser... Apo mia polukatoikia kharismene stous nekrous eos te Dresde tou 1945 pou isopedonetai se mia nukhta
gemate lampse...
Polles apo tis istories tes sulloges ekhoun diakrithei se logotekhnikous diagonismous eno ekhoun demosieuthei se anthologies tromou sten Ellada kai to exoteriko."�
�A riff on The Hockey Sweaterfor girls, an intergenerational story of the shared love of the sport, and a celebration of the storied Number 9 in hockey.
9-year-old Gabe (Gabriella) Murray lives and breathes hockey. She's the youngest player on her new team, she has a nifty move that her teammates call "the Gabe," and she shares a lucky number with her hero, Hayley Wickenheiser: number 22. But when her coach hands out the team jerseys, Gabe is stuck with number 9. Crushed, Gabe wants to give up hockey altogether. How can she play without her lucky number? Gabe's grandmother soon sets her straight, though--from her own connection to the number 9 in her hockey-playing days to all the greats she cheered for who wore it, she soon convinces Gabe that this new number might not be so bad after all.
A lovely intergenerational tale and a history of the storied number 9 in hockey, The Highest Number in the Worldis a must-have for any hockey fan."�
