�Athena, 404 p.Kh.
E kharitomene ZenaIs ergazetai sten pole tes Pallados Athenas san mageirissa, sto spiti tou Athenaiou strategou Deinarkhou. To truphero eidullio pou anaptussetai anamesa s auten kai ston goeteutiko aphente tes, ten boethoun na xeperasei ton atukho erota tes me ton Spartiate oplite Libu, ton adelpho tou nikete stous Aigos Potamous, Lussandrou. Omos sten Athena ton Triakonta Turannon o Deinarkhos kinduneuei logo ton demokratikon tou phronematon kai e eroteumene ZenaIs kanei o,ti mporei gia na ton prostatepsei...
Oi skeuories pou uphainontai eis baros tes, semadeuoun anexitela ten zoe tes. Apophasizei na phugei gia ten Epheso, akolouthontas to strateuma tes Spartes pou kinei ekstrateia enantion ton Person gia na apeleutherosei tis ellenikes poleis tes Mikras Asias. Omos e Lakhesis ekhei alla skhedia gi auten. Ekei tha sunantesei xana tous duo moiraious andres tes zoes tes, kai tora pia tha prepei na epilexei enan ap tous duo...
Ena realistiko, sunarpastiko, peripeteiodes, erotiko muthistorema pou anabionei me ekplektiko tropo ton arkhaio kosmo. Ena muthistorema-apokalupse pou kathelonei ton anagnoste!"�
�S' opoia glossa ki an to peis...
...na to xereis. To pio semantiko einai e agape.
B' Pagkosmios Polemos, ta khronia tou polemou... Mia alethine istoria agapes pou gennetheke mesa stis phloges tou polemou kai paramenei dunate sto perasma ton khronon. Enas Ellenas kai mia neare gunaika apo ten Oukrania tha antimetopisoun mazi tis apanthropes sunthekes sto stratopedo sugkentroses tou Lantsentorph, konta ste Bienne. Duo neoi, makhetes tes zoes, pou gnorizoun na paleuoun, na khairontai kai na zoun ten kathe stigme. Duo anthropoi pou tha akolouthesoun kheri-kheri to monopati tes zoes. Ma pano ap ola duo neoi pou xeroun n' agapoun giati etan panta bathia rizomene mesa tous e piste oti..."to pio semantiko einai e agape "S' opoia glossa ki an to peis...""␀␀`@"␀␀�@"	
